"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60716"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村会議員であり土木業者社長の娘。お嬢様で都会に憧れる田舎娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動は偉そうだが、簡単に誘導できる「ちょろイン」である"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自意識過剰で見栄っ張りなため、過激なプレイをつい承諾してしまったりして墓穴を掘るタイプ。自己を解放する心地よさが快楽と直結した結果、露出系プレイに目覚めてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15822","sourceWorkId":"24956","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村会議員であり、土木業者社長の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動は偉そうだが簡単に誘導できる “ちょろイン”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自意識過剰で見栄っ張りなため、過激なプレイをつい承諾してしまって墓穴を掘るタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自己を開放する心地良さが快楽と直結した結果、露出系プレイに目覚めてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53259"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11015197e14a11cbe7be53db7575d0bf0f07097843a642a64638b76e5596d4de.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e87f24e8e0bf8a840665821f882c5897d1f35cd057b21a9594fb30095122bbf0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水美紗","creatorId":"vndb:s1975","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1975","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1975","name":"よもぎかすみ(蓬かすみ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:211829:53259:21151:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c60717","characterName":"碓井 美千子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53260","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"211829"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15823"],"vndbCharacterId":"c60717"},"originalCharacterName":"碓井 美千子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She transferred to a branch school out in the countryside because of her strong distrust of others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she shows a composed behavior befitting her age she actually has no confidence in herself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60717"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"分校をまとめる若き女教師。実は強い人間不信から都会の学校をやめて、逃げるように田舎の分校の教職に志願した。逃避自覚あり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年相応に落ち着いた態度をみせるが上面だけ。本当は自分に自信ゼロ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hに関しては状況や快楽に弱く流されてしまう。強引に押されるとＮＯといえない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人の立場でマウントをとろうとするが、中身は年上の主人公に翻弄される形で、むしろ自分がマウントをとられてしまう結果に。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15823","sourceWorkId":"24956","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い人間不信から都会の学校を辞め、逃げるように田舎の分校へ転任した女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年相応に落ち着いた態度を見せるが上面だけ。 本当は自分に自信がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチに関しては状況や快楽に弱く、流されてしまうタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人の立場で主導権を得ようとするも、中身は年上の主人公に翻弄されてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53260"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d546671b2b6c99a1626641296bcfa6414c7b49a552cdb1b250bcb1fcddd6c4a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a92b33f05c7f53fdb03f223e35005e23a3d29be6b10daae02c996a8c02455bc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"薫子","creatorId":"vndb:s10539","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10539","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10539","name":"薫子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73311","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p200","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p200","name":"CLOCKUP","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:24956:724","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p200","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p200","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p200","name":"CLOCKUP","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer